; ── dhatu (verb roots) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
; dhatu = verb root. direction is observer-relative (flow between loci).
; sthita carries DEFAULT subject perspective: kshaya if subject typically
; loses, vriddhi if subject typically gains. detect-direction walks sthita
; to find this. Full flow-based entity resolution comes later.
; form nodes have janya back to dhatu + sthita for grammar features.

; ── departure/loss (default: subject departs/loses) ──────────────────

